118-### Menu density
119-
120-Use `menuDensity="compact"` to reduce the aside width, item height, icon size, spacing, and corner
121-radius without changing how the navigation behaves. Density is independent from the collapsed or
122-expanded state controlled by `compact`, so both properties can be combined.
123-
