201-    );
202-  }}
203-/>;
204-```
205-
206-Only visible regular leaf items can be pinned. Actions, dividers, group headers, **More**, and
207-**All pages** are excluded. Group children are eligible and can be pinned from either an expanded
208-group or its popup. In a compact sidebar, pin controls are available in group and **More** popups;
209-the solo item popup remains an informational label without actions.
210-
211-By default, an active quick-access item is highlighted only in the quick-access section. Set
212-`quickAccessHighlightInMainMenu` to preserve its highlight in both places. Disable
213-`enableQuickAccess` to hide the section and pin controls without clearing item flags.
214-
